2fa81993-8355-44e5-97e5-429eaeb119cb	2010年北京市昌平区麻疹流行病学分析	Measles in Changping District of Beijing 2010	WANG Tao	\N	2011	\N	\N	Objective In order to understand the epidemiological characteristics of measles in 2010 provide evidence for developing scientific and targeted prevention and control measures of measles in future. Methods Descriptive research methods were used for epidemiological analysis with 2010 measles epidemic information. Results A total of 239 cases of measles were reported in Changping district in 2010 with the annual incidence rate of 30.87/10^5 per year. Area clustering was obvious the concentration of population flow between urban and rural areas had a higher incidence of measles such as Dongxiaokou town and Beiqijia town. The incidence peaked from April to June (70.29%). Among 239 cases of measles 57.32% were >15 years old 28.03% were <1 years old that indicated the adult and young age groups onset mode. There were 21.34% 76.57% and 2.09% of the cases with immune history non-immune history and unknown immune history. The blood collection rate of suspected measles cases was 92.01%. The laboratory confirmed cases accounted for 86.19% of all cases. Conclusion Improving routine immunization rate strengthening the measles epidemic monitoring and disposal are the key work of measles district control.	\N	\N	北京	\N	upload	\N	f	done	7	0	2026-09-28 07:19:07.692482+00	2026-09-28 07:19:07.692487+00	\N	\N	0	0	0	0.000000	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	0	\N	\N	\N	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
5e30fee0-45c3-40df-aa5b-9b02ce691938	某部间隔18年两次乙肝疫苗全员接种后免疫状况调查分析_胡福宝	\N	胡福宝	中外医学研究	2011	10.14033/j.cnki.cfmr.2011.11.007	\N	目的 通过本所相距18年两次乙肝疫苗全员接种后，期间的1992年、2009年及2010年的资料整理，对三次血清乙肝表面抗体（HBsAb）情况进行比较，以及资料显示的部分人员表面抗体不同时段变化情况统计分析，表面抗体阳性率与年龄是否相关，探讨本所18年坚持全员全程乙肝疫苗接种的效果以及影响乙肝表面抗体阳性率因素。方法 以1991年、2009年及2010年三个时间段本所人员HBsAb血清学检查结果统计分析，部分特定人员不同时间段表面抗体的变化统计分析。结果 1992年HBsAb阳性率45.42%（129/284），2009年阳性率73.06%（179/245），2010年91.37%（180/197），三者间比较相差显著。配对比较亦然。有55人经2009年全员接种后，转阳率达72.73%（40/55），三个资料均有显示的29人，经历18年多次乙肝接种后，仍有5人始终表抗阴性。有6人1991年表抗阳性，2009年变阴性，再种后，4人转阳，2人未查。HBsAb阳性率三个整体资料均显示与年龄无关，但55人资料与年龄相关。结论 本所经多次乙肝疫苗接种后，乙肝表面抗体阳性率高，乙肝滴度可因时间推移而转阴，可因免疫应答再转阳。部分人员难以产生表面抗体。HBsAb阳性率或与年龄不相关尚不明确。	\N	\N	陕西	\N	upload	\N	f	done	7	0	2026-09-28 07:19:07.698321+00	2026-09-28 07:19:07.698325+00	\N	\N	0	0	0	0.000000	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	0	\N	\N	\N	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
